# SideQuests.io — environment configuration
#
# The app runs FULLY WITHOUT these variables, using an in-browser LocalRepository
# (localStorage) seeded with demo data. This is ideal for development and demos.
#
# To switch to the production Supabase backend, copy this file to `.env.local`,
# fill in the values from your Supabase project (Settings → API), then run the
# migrations in supabase/migrations and supabase/seed.sql.

